From 6687b5e005dbf092778a6adedf6a69a6f389947f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Git Gud <gg@local>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:38:22 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] gpui: letter_spacing on TextStyle/TextRun/FontRun (port
 of zed-industries/zed#53475 without text_transform)

cosmic-text (Linux) takes spacing in em, so gpui_wgpu divides the px value by the font size.
---
